5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I want to make sure we can actually finish the project on time. I'll check the firms and the depot notes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A sensible start, Kenji. I am interested in how the park is actually used and the environmental stresses it faces.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I... I want to know who will take care of the park every day. I'll look at the groundskeeping and volunteers.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with the need for practical data. I want to see how previous projects have held up over time.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I shall look into the financial side of maintenance and the habitat fund terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
