55,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option D is on the south side, which is easier to build. But Option A might avoid the deep digging risks.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option A addresses the drainage and heat issues directly, though we must ensure the boardwalks don't block the tram commuters.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minato,,We have volunteers for habitats and sports. So A or D would be easier for the staff to manage.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option A is similar to the overflow basin that is still working. Option C is too risky given the tree death records.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option A is perfectly funded by the habitat fund, but the upkeep is high. Option B is cheapest to maintain but unfunded.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the clay for A, but the ""shallow work"" quote makes me think it's okay.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,Option B would likely exacerbate the heat island effect we saw in the August readings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minato,,I think Option A is nice because the habitat volunteers already exist.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Minako,,I cannot support C. The city cannot maintain trees. A is the most durable choice.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"While A is expensive to maintain, the capital cost is covered. B and D would require funds we might not have.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I like A. It seems safer for the ground than a massive plaza or sports complex.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. It solves the drainage problem and provides cooling.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote for A too. It feels peaceful and the volunteers can help.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Minako,,A is the only one that aligns with the evidence of what actually lasts in this city.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If we can manage the upkeep, A is the most viable given the funding terms.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Kenji,,It's settled then!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,A rational conclusion.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'm happy with this.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I concur.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
